{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677020/extras/1441fd1d5d3978fd45ad1bd8fcce29e5.avif?t=1764948060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677020/extras_big/1441fd1d5d3978fd45ad1bd8fcce29e5.webp?t=1764948060 width=1560 height=593 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re about to dive into an erotic visual novel with point-and-click elements \u2014 except the story breaks before you even read the first line of dialogue. You launch the game expecting gorgeous girls and a flood of spicy scenes, but everything immediately falls apart: the interface glitches, the music stutters, and Candy \u2014 a character who should be following a fixed script \u2014 suddenly speaks directly to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677020/extras/45d89176f5370fe5af7a2a1909a1bca9.avif?t=1764948060\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to explore corrupted worlds buried under layers of abandoned source code and meet alluring girls who were never supposed to exist in this game at all. Don\u2019t let them fool you\u2026 because beneath all the sex and seduction lies someone\u2019s hidden agenda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677020/extras/26d3c768823423a88ee9645a959bb69a.poster.avif?t=1764948060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677020/extras/26d3c768823423a88ee9645a959bb69a.webm?t=1764948060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677020/extras/26d3c768823423a88ee9645a959bb69a.mp4?t=1764948060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Candy grows more persistent. She rewrites dialogues, hijacks events, and closes paths as if she\u2019s trying to control every step you take. And the deeper you go, the clearer it becomes: the game isn\u2019t just broken\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677020/extras/4116a2e078d261cd67312f4e3b1d5ffa.poster.avif?t=1764948060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677020/extras/4116a2e078d261cd67312f4e3b1d5ffa.webm?t=1764948060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677020/extras/4116a2e078d261cd67312f4e3b1d5ffa.mp4?t=1764948060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026it\u2019s trying to rewrite you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Do you beat me? I beat you!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677020/6341355f1522eaddefebf8c1e2433013e0debe9b.jpg"},{"name":"Men's choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677020/948a067ed548b9b7c9ca9ef8505b3371ec2dd32a.jpg"},{"name":"Bugs of the year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677020/35c06b6c88e0cb6f9d80e1d9c65b9c71b7bc889a.jpg"},{"name":"Think with me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677020/85e8bcdb146b8ee860172290b589aa5928b8ad2e.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Cupcake? ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.